function updateOpponent(){const op=mode==='tournament'?tournamentOpponents[tournamentRound]:{name:'DIO BRANDO',avatar:'DIO',portrait:'dio',caption:mode==='bot'?'ADVERSÁRIO CONTROLADO PELO BOT':'AS PEÇAS DAS SOMBRAS'};const twoPlayer=isTwoPlayerMode();document.querySelector('#opponent-name').textContent=twoPlayer?playerNames.b:op.name+(mode==='bot'?' · BOT':'');document.querySelector('#current-player-name').textContent=playerNames.w;document.querySelector('#captures-title').textContent='TROFÉUS DE '+playerNames.w.toLocaleUpperCase();document.querySelector('#white-legend-name').textContent=playerNames.w;document.querySelector('#black-legend-name').textContent=twoPlayer?playerNames.b:op.name;const blackCharacter=twoPlayer?playerCharacters.b:op.portrait,blackProfile=characterPhotos[blackCharacter],whiteProfile=characterPhotos[playerCharacters.w];document.querySelector('#opponent-avatar').innerHTML=blackProfile?'<img class="character-photo" src="assets/fotos/'+encodeURIComponent(blackProfile.file).replaceAll('%2F','/')+'" alt="Foto de '+blackProfile.name+'">':'<svg class="portrait" viewBox="0 0 64 64" role="img" aria-label="Pixel art de '+op.name+'"><use href="characters.svg#'+op.portrait+'"></use></svg>';document.querySelector('#player-avatar').innerHTML='<img class="character-photo" src="assets/fotos/'+encodeURIComponent(whiteProfile.file).replaceAll('%2F','/')+'" alt="Foto de '+whiteProfile.name+'">';document.querySelector('#opponent-caption').textContent=mode==='tournament'?op.caption+' · PODER: '+(op.powerName||powerInfo[op.power].title):twoPlayer?blackProfile.name.toLocaleUpperCase()+' · PODER ALEATÓRIO: '+(powerInfo[localPowers.b]?.title||'—'):op.caption;if(twoPlayer)document.querySelector('#current-caption').textContent=whiteProfile.name.toLocaleUpperCase()+' · PODER ALEATÓRIO: '+(powerInfo[localPowers.w]?.title||'—');renderBracket()}
